{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03544","headline":"出境游山二首 二 · 王勃","name":"出境游山二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"振翮凌霜吹，正月伫天浔。\n回镳凌翠壑，飞轸控青岑。\n岩深灵竈没，涧毁石渠沈。\n宫阙云间近，江山物外临。\n玉坛栖暮夜，珠洞结秋阴。\n萧萧离俗影，扰扰望乡心。\n谁意山游好屡伤人事侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}